{"resourceIdentifier":"3017","resourceName":"Jiangsu REO-ECO PET RECYCLING PROJECT","description":"Jiangsu REO-ECO PET Recycling Project (hereafter referred to as the Project, or the proposed project) is located in No. 28, Nanhai Road, Hongze Economic Development Zone, Huai'an City, Jiangsu Province, P.R. China. \r\nThe Project is invested, constructed and operated by Jiangsu REO-ECO New Material Tech Co., Ltd (hereafter referred to as the Project proponents). The objective of the Project is to collect the waste plastic and utilize it to product Food-grade Polyethylene Terephthalate (PET).\r\nIn the Project, the Polyethylene Terephthalate (PET) residues will be sorted, classified, washed with hot water, dried, compacted, pelletized, and then used as raw materials for production of PET. Prior to the implementation of the Project, the PET residues in municipal solid waste (MSW) were deposited in a disposal site.\r\nThe Project recycled PET from (MSW), and then process them into intermediate products, which displacing the production of virgin materials in dedicated facilities, thereby resulting in avoidance of energy use and the related emissions.\r\nThe total quantity of PET recycled during the operation period is estimated to be 30,000 tons per year. The estimated annual average emission reduction generated by the Project over the crediting period is 10,247tCO2e per year by avoiding energy consumption.","location":{"latitude":33.304324,"longitude":118.893072},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-05-12","endExclusive":"2022-06-12","endInclusive":"2022-06-11"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3017"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu REO-ECO New Material Tech Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu Province, China"}]